     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Dear User group,<div>I am trying to deploy a shiny app for the first time and I get this error message:</div><div><br></div><div><div>Preparing to deploy application...Error: HTTP 404</div><div>GET <a href=\"https://api.shinyapps.io/v1/applications/223072\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://api.shinyapps.io/v1/applications/223072&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792360478747000&amp;usg=AOvVaw03aDpD7qLOcS_p7s5ZOxoh\">https://api.shinyapps.io/v1/applications/223072</a></div><div>Not Found</div><div>Execution halted</div></div><div><br></div><div>In the dashboard I get this message<br></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(157,84,91);font-family:&quot;Open Sans&quot;,&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;text-align:center;background-color:rgb(254,240,240)\">Account is suspended until {{ suspended_until | date:&#39;medium&#39; }}</span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(157,84,91);font-family:&quot;Open Sans&quot;,&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;text-align:center;background-color:rgb(254,240,240)\"> due to &quot;{{ currentAccount[&#39;suspended_reason&#39;] | lowercase }}&quot;</span><span style=\"color:rgb(157,84,91);font-family:&quot;Open Sans&quot;,&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;text-align:center;background-color:rgb(254,240,240)\">.</span><br style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(157,84,91);font-family:&quot;Open Sans&quot;,&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;text-align:center;background-color:rgb(254,240,240)\"><span style=\"color:rgb(157,84,91);font-family:&quot;Open Sans&quot;,&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;text-align:center;background-color:rgb(254,240,240)\">All of your applications will be unavailable until then, or you can </span><a href=\"https://www.shinyapps.io/admin/#/account/billing\" style=\"color:rgb(91,144,191);box-sizing:border-box;background:rgb(254,240,240);font-family:&quot;Open Sans&quot;,&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;text-align:center\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://www.shinyapps.io/admin/%23/account/billing&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792360478748000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3C16dNK427hfsWkKh_C1bN\">upgrade</a><span style=\"color:rgb(157,84,91);font-family:&quot;Open Sans&quot;,&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;text-align:center;background-color:rgb(254,240,240)\"> your account.</span><br></div><div><br></div><div>What am I doing wrong? My shiny app works fine from RStudio on my computer.<br>Best regards,</div><div>Viki.</div></div>"
    ]
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "OhxnC7hwAwAJ",
   "from": "Joshua Spiewak",
   "author": "299a5089d6c6c523",
   "date": "2017-10-10T13:30:36Z",
   "subject": "Re: Error 404",
   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">The 404 error is likely because you had deleted the application, and then attempted to deploy it again.<div>If you delete an application, you need to clear out rsconnect/<a href=\"http://shinyapps.io/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://shinyapps.io/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792360478748000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3shkHa1zYkGoTAMUeUR7OX\">shinyapps.io/</a>&lt;accountname&gt;/&lt;applicationname&gt;.dcf which stores the application id.</div><div><br></div><div>The unsubstituted text issue is a known UI issue when you deep link into the dashboard.</div></div>"
    ],
    [
     3,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div><br><br>On Sunday, October 8, 2017 at 5:57:27 PM UTC-4, <a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">vbro...@uni.sydney.edu.au</a> wrote:<blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0;margin-left:0.8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><div dir=\"ltr\">Dear User group,<div>I am trying to deploy a shiny app for the first time and I get this error message:</div><div><br></div><div><div>Preparing to deploy application...Error: HTTP 404</div><div>GET <a href=\"https://api.shinyapps.io/v1/applications/223072\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://api.shinyapps.io/v1/applications/223072&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792360478748000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2rjzMYdvbGg8U_tKysTluT\">https://api.shinyapps.io/v1/applications/223072</a></div><div>Not Found</div><div>Execution halted</div></div><div><br></div><div>In the dashboard I get this message<br></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(157,84,91);font-family:&quot;Open Sans&quot;,&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;text-align:center;background-color:rgb(254,240,240)\">Account is suspended until {{ suspended_until | date:&#39;medium&#39; }}</span><span style=\"color:rgb(157,84,91);font-family:&quot;Open Sans&quot;,&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;text-align:center;background-color:rgb(254,240,240)\"> due to &quot;{{ currentAccount[&#39;suspended_reason&#39;] | lowercase }}&quot;</span><span style=\"color:rgb(157,84,91);font-family:&quot;Open Sans&quot;,&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;text-align:center;background-color:rgb(254,240,240)\">.</span><br style=\"color:rgb(157,84,91);font-family:&quot;Open Sans&quot;,&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;text-align:center;background-color:rgb(254,240,240)\"><span style=\"color:rgb(157,84,91);font-family:&quot;Open Sans&quot;,&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;text-align:center;background-color:rgb(254,240,240)\">All of your applications will be unavailable until then, or you can </span><a href=\"https://www.shinyapps.io/admin/#/account/billing\" style=\"color:rgb(91,144,191);background:rgb(254,240,240);font-family:&quot;Open Sans&quot;,&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;text-align:center\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://www.shinyapps.io/admin/%23/account/billing&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792360478748000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3C16dNK427hfsWkKh_C1bN\">upgrade</a><span style=\"color:rgb(157,84,91);font-family:&quot;Open Sans&quot;,&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;text-align:center;background-color:rgb(254,240,240)\"> your account.</span><br></div><div><br></div><div>What am I doing wrong? My shiny app works fine from RStudio on my computer.<br>Best regards,</div><div>Viki.</div></div></blockquote></div></div>"
